00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:16,720
Mr. Song.

294
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:17,920
My head hurts.

295
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:18,680
Ergui.

296
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:21,960
Mr. Song.

297
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:23,860
What should I do

298
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:25,160
about my headache?

299
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,320
It's throbbing.

300
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:28,480
I can't keep being dizzy all day.

301
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:31,520
I can't treat your illness here.

302
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:34,160
You need to go to the big hospital at the Forestry Bureau.

303
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:35,760
How many times have I told you?

304
00:15:35,760 --> 00:15:37,880
Why don't you listen?

305
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:38,720
No.

306
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,880
You have to treat me.

307
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:42,000
Mr. Song, just prescribe me some medicine.

308
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:42,800
Painkillers.

309
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:46,800
I don't have

310
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:48,460
what you're looking for here.

311
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,120
The past is in the past.

312
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,280
Just let it go.

313
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,820
You don't have a headache.

314
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:55,440
You have a sickness of the heart.

315
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,700
You have to cure it yourselves, you know?

316
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:00,850
What do you mean?

317
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,400
Mr. Song, just

318
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:04,000
prescribe me some medicine.

319
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,840
I'm talking to you, Mr. Song.
